<section class="border-b border-border bg-card"><div class="container-page py-14 sm:py-20"><div class="mb-8"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-muted-foreground"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a aria-current="page" class="hover:text-accent active" data-status="active" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/' ) ); ?>">Services</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-current="page" class="text-foreground">AI Pet Health Monitoring</span></li></ol></nav></div><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>AI Pet Health Monitoring</p><h1 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl leading-[1.08] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Health signals your pet cannot tell you about</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Continuous vitals, early-warning alerts and vet-ready health records.</p><div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-foreground transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/contact/' ) ); ?>">Book a consultation</a><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent" href="#faq">Read the FAQ</a></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Introduction</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Understanding ai pet health monitoring</h2></div><div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><p>Animals are evolutionarily wired to mask illness. By the time a limp, a cough or a skipped meal is obvious to an owner, a condition has often been developing quietly for weeks. PawlogicTech closes that gap by measuring the physiology that never lies.</p><p>Our monitoring platform reads resting heart rate, respiratory rate, activity load, sleep architecture, scratching and drinking behaviour, then compares each value against your individual animal's own baseline rather than a generic breed average.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-background p-8 sm:p-10"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted-foreground">The problem</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl leading-snug sm:text-3xl">Why illness is usually found late</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Most pet health decisions are made from a snapshot: one weight, one temperature, one fifteen-minute consult, once or twice a year. Between those visits, owners rely on memory and intuition, and subtle deterioration is invisible.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Resting heart rate can rise for weeks before cardiac disease is diagnosed.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Gradual weight change of 6–8% is almost impossible to notice by eye.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Night-time restlessness is one of the earliest osteoarthritis signals and is routinely missed.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground"></span>Owners under-report symptoms simply because they did not witness them.</li></ul></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-primary p-8 text-primary-foreground sm:p-10"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Our solution</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl leading-snug sm:text-3xl">A continuous, individualised health baseline</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">PawlogicTech builds a personal physiological fingerprint for every animal during a 14-day learning period, then watches for statistically meaningful deviation. You are alerted about change that matters, not about every normal fluctuation.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Sensor fusion across collar, environment and feeding data.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Per-animal anomaly models tuned to breed, age, weight and climate.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Alert thresholds reviewed by our veterinary advisory panel.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Exportable, timestamped records your own vet can act on.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Benefits</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">What you get out of it</h2></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Earlier intervention</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Trend alerts typically surface change 9–21 days before an owner reports a visible symptom.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Lower lifetime cost</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Conditions caught in an early stage are cheaper to treat and far less likely to become chronic emergencies.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Better vet consults</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Arrive with 90 days of objective data instead of a description of last Tuesday.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift"><h3 class="text-xl">Peace of mind</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Quiet by design. You hear from us when something genuinely deserves attention.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-secondary"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Features</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Everything included as standard</h2></div><dl class="grid gap-x-10 gap-y-8 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Baseline learning</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">A two-week calibration establishes normal ranges unique to your animal.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Multi-signal fusion</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">Heart rate, respiration, movement, sleep, hydration and feeding are read together, not in isolation.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Severity grading</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">Every alert carries a confidence score and a plain-language recommended action.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Vet-ready reporting</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">One-tap PDF summaries formatted for clinical review, including raw trend charts.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Multi-pet households</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">Signal separation keeps records accurate when several animals share a space.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-display text-lg">Private by default</dt><dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-sage-foreground/80">Data is encrypted in transit and at rest, and is never sold to third parties.</dd></div></dl></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>How it works</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Four steps from setup to insight</h2></div><ol class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><li class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-sage">01</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl">Fit and pair</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Attach the collar module and place the room sensor. Pairing takes under five minutes.</p></li><li class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-sage">02</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl">Learn the baseline</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Two weeks of ordinary life gives the model everything it needs.</p></li><li class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-sage">03</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl">Monitor continuously</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Readings stream around the clock and are scored against the baseline.</p></li><li class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7"><span class="font-display text-3xl text-sage">04</span><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl">Act on alerts</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">You receive a graded notification with a clear next step and a shareable report.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Specialisms</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Inside AI Pet Health Monitoring</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Five focused capabilities. Explore whichever matches the problem you are trying to solve.</p></div><ul class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-health-monitoring/dog-health-ai/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">Dog Health AI</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Canine monitoring tuned to breed, size and life stage</p><spa