-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">Health Reports</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Months of data, distilled into one page a vet can use</p><span class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div></a></li></ul></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center"><div><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Who needs this</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Households and organisations this is built for</h2></div><dl class="mt-8 space-y-6"><div class="rule-accent"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Senior pets</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Animals over seven, where small changes carry disproportionate clinical weight.</dd></div><div class="rule-accent"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Chronic conditions</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Cardiac, renal, endocrine and orthopaedic cases needing between-visit visibility.</dd></div><div class="rule-accent"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Post-operative recovery</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Objective evidence that healing is on track once your pet leaves the clinic.</dd></div><div class="rule-accent"><dt class="font-display text-xl">Breeders and catteries</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Population-level oversight with individual-level accuracy.</dd></div></dl></div><img alt="Veterinary professional reviewing ai pet health monitoring data for a patient" class="w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-lift" decoding="async" height="900" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() ); ?>/assets/images/vet-review.webp" width="1200"/></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-primary text-primary-foreground"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-3xl"><p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Why PawlogicTech</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Clinically governed, privacy-first, and deliberately quiet</h2><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">Every threshold in AI Pet Health Monitoring is reviewed by our veterinary advisory panel before release. We tune for clinical usefulness rather than notification volume, we compare your animal only against itself, and we never sell your data. Everything exports, because the record belongs to you and should follow your animal wherever it goes.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24" id="faq"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>FAQ</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">AI Pet Health Monitoring questions, answered</h2></div><div class="divide-y divide-border rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card"><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Does AI pet health monitoring replace my veterinarian?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">No, and it is not designed to. PawlogicTech is a monitoring and triage tool. It surfaces objective evidence earlier so that your veterinarian can diagnose and treat sooner. Every alert directs you to professional care when clinically appropriate.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">How accurate are the alerts?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Accuracy depends on baseline quality. After a complete 14-day calibration our resting heart rate and respiration readings track clinical measurements closely, and severity grading is tuned to minimise false alarms rather than maximise alert volume.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">Will my pet tolerate wearing the device?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The collar module weighs less than a standard ID tag and is rated for dogs and cats above 2.5kg. Most animals stop noticing it within a day.</p></details><details class="group px-6 py-5"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-6 text-left font-display text-lg">What happens to my data?<span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">It is encrypted, stored under your account, and exportable or deletable at any time. We do not sell data to insurers, advertisers or brokers.</p></details></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-card"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Related services</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Services that pair well with this one</h2></div><ul class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-behavior-analysis/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">AI Behavior Analysis</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Understand anxiety, aggression and stress through measured behaviour.</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/ai-pet-training/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">AI Pet Training</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Adaptive, reward-based training programmes that measure real progress.</p></div></a></li><li><a href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/smart-pet-care/' ) ); ?>"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-xl">Smart Pet Care</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Connected feeding, hydration, climate and daily-care automation.</p></div></a></li></ul></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Further reading</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Articles from our veterinary and behavioural team</h2></div><ul class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3"><li><article><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Pet Health · 8 min read</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl leading-snug"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/early-signs-of-illness-in-dogs/' ) ); ?>">The Early Signs of Illness in Dogs Most Owners Miss</a></h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">By the time a dog looks unwell, the condition has usually been developing for weeks. These are the eight signals that appear first, and why almost nobody notices them.</p></article></li><li><article><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Behaviour · 7 min read</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl leading-snug"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/how-ai-detects-pet-anxiety/' ) ); ?>">How AI Detects Pet Anxiety Before You Do</a></h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The behaviour you most need to understand happens when nobody is home. Measurement solves a problem that observation structurally cannot.</p></article></li><li><article><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Nutrition · 6 min read</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-xl leading-snug"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/blog/smart-feeding-and-pet-obesity/' ) ); ?>">Smart Feeding and the Pet Obesity Problem</a></h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Nobody intends to overfeed. Portion drift is a measurement failure, not a discipline failure, and measurement is the thing that fixes it.</p></article></li></ul></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-primary px-8 py-16 text-primary-foreground sm:px-14"><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-accent/25 blur-3xl"></span><div class="relative max-w-2xl"><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Ready to put AI Pet Health Monitoring to work?</h2><p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75">A short consultation tells us your animal, your household and your goal. We will recommend the smallest configuration that solves it.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-foreground transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/contact/' ) ); ?>">Book a consultation</a><a aria-current="page" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-primary-foreground/30 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors hover:border-primary-foreground active" data-status="active" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/services/' ) ); ?>">Explore services</a></div></div></div></div></section><script>(function(a,f){let l;try{l=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(a)||"{}")}catch{return}const n=l?.[f||history.state?.__TSR_key];let c=!1;for(const t in n){const e=n[t],o=e?.scrollX,s=e?.scrollY;if(Number.isFinite(o)&&Number.isFinite(s)){if(t==="window")scrollTo(o,s),c=!0;else if(t)try{const r=document.querySelector(t);r&&(r.scrollLeft=o,r.scrollTop=s)}catch{}}}if(c)return;const i=location.hash.slice(1);if(i){const t=history.state?.__hashScrollIntoViewOptions??!0;if(t){const e=document.getElementById(i);e&&e.scrollIntoView(t)}return}scrollTo(0,0)})("tsr-scroll-restoration-v1_3");document.currentScript.remove()</script>
